error[V0105]: module `db` is not public, so `pub use` cannot make `db::connect` public; write `pub mod db;`
 --> crates/varyk/tests/fixtures/errors/v0105_pub_use_private/main.vr:3:9
  |
1 | mod db;
  | --- declared here without `pub`
2 |
3 | pub use db::connect;
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^ module `db` is not public, so `pub use` cannot make `db::connect` public; write `pub mod db;`
  |
  = note: an item made public with `pub use` keeps its own path too, and every module on that path must be public; in Rust terms, the generated Rust names the item by its full path
help: insert `pub ` before `mod`
